    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546440/extras/fbd36a00df00f0124e92175980681edf.avif?t=1752642527\" data-has-big width=800 height=1446 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rentlord</strong> is a roguelike real estate management game where you build and expand your own property portfolio while overcoming challenging obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546440/extras/f5be0e3260c83dfee3d167b4a2baec69.poster.avif?t=1752642527\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546440/extras/f5be0e3260c83dfee3d167b4a2baec69.webm?t=1752642527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546440/extras/f5be0e3260c83dfee3d167b4a2baec69.mp4?t=1752642527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore The Market!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Browse a variety of properties available for purchase, each with unique benefits and strategic potential to expand your real estate empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546440/extras/a2c1b3289136198e7009f4a6baaf22eb.avif?t=1752642527\" width=756 height=246 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Power Up with Plugins!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Browse a variety of powerful plugins in the shop, each designed to enhance your strategy and maximize your income. Choose the ones that best suit your playstyle and expand your real estate empire with unique advantages and boosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546440/extras/c458b3ee5f5734f807f6c036bb444f40.avif?t=1752642527\" width=729 height=374 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect Your Rent!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See your strategic decisions pay off as you collect rent from your properties</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546440/extras/887552675a0c9aff710081073dc30c65.poster.avif?t=1752642527\" width=800 height=546 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546440/extras/887552675a0c9aff710081073dc30c65.webm?t=1752642527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546440/extras/887552675a0c9aff710081073dc30c65.mp4?t=1752642527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rentlord</strong> is a roguelike real estate management game where you build and expand your own property portfolio while overcoming challenging obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546440/extras/f5be0e3260c83dfee3d167b4a2baec69.poster.avif?t=1752642527\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546440/extras/f5be0e3260c83dfee3d167b4a2baec69.webm?t=1752642527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546440/extras/f5be0e3260c83dfee3d167b4a2baec69.mp4?t=1752642527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore The Market!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Browse a variety of properties available for purchase, each with unique benefits and strategic potential to expand your real estate empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546440/extras/a2c1b3289136198e7009f4a6baaf22eb.avif?t=1752642527\" width=756 height=246 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Power Up with Plugins!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Browse a variety of powerful plugins in the shop, each designed to enhance your strategy and maximize your income. Choose the ones that best suit your playstyle and expand your real estate empire with unique advantages and boosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546440/extras/c458b3ee5f5734f807f6c036bb444f40.avif?t=1752642527\" width=729 height=374 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect Your Rent!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See your strategic decisions pay off as you collect rent from your properties</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546440/extras/887552675a0c9aff710081073dc30c65.poster.avif?t=1752642527\" width=800 height=546 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546440/extras/887552675a0c9aff710081073dc30c65.webm?t=1752642527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546440/extras/887552675a0c9aff710081073dc30c65.mp4?t=1752642527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Rentlord is a combo-making roguelike real estate game where you buy properties, manage your income, and overcome unique weekly challenges. Strategic property upgrades and plugins with high combo potential, each run offers new opportunities to maximize rent, while avoiding taxes!",
